{"title":"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Algebra:_Generalized)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Algebra: Generalized)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Algebra:_Specific)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Algebra: Specific)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Geometry)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Geometry)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/bee949613216ef2eeb63632d409ab60af8fc8b60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{7}\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{7}\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{7}\\right)\\left(-\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{7}\\right).\\]\" width=\"580\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Algebra:_Generalized.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Algebra:_Generalized)\">Solution 1 (Algebra: Generalized)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Algebra: Generalized)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>More generally, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/2250f77619481b17caaa125120ce90374d066521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z)=\\left(\\sqrt5,\\sqrt6,\\sqrt7\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"191\" height=\"32\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80dab5427083d005a04c8181c8bb63a901b26e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(x^2,y^2,z^2\\right)=(5,6,7).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"169\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>We rewrite the original expression in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/692e3bee67c91837acbdcf63862b3b3c94366f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"32\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/2/3e286767c12d601703a768718fbb9fed407df032.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" /> then apply the difference of squares repeatedly:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ec5c1f4d4d4c915102574facf28733f7b427741.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (x+y+z)(x+y-z)(x-y+z)(-x+y+z) &amp;= \\left[((x+y)+z)((x+y)-z)\\right]\\left[((z+(x-y))(z-(x-y))\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\left[(x+y)^2-z^2\\right]\\left[z^2 - (x-y)^2\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\left[x^2+2xy+y^2-z^2\\right]\\left[z^2-x^2+2xy-y^2\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\left[2xy + \\left(x^2+y^2-z^2\\right)\\right]\\left[2xy - \\left(x^2+y^2-z^2\\right)\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\left(2xy\\right)^2 - \\left(x^2+y^2-z^2\\right)^2 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(2\\cdot\\sqrt5\\cdot\\sqrt6\\right)^2 - \\left(5+6-7\\right)^2 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{104}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"824\" height=\"206\" />\n<u><b>Remark</b></u>\n</p><p>From this solution, note that the original expression has cyclic symmetry with respect to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/692e3bee67c91837acbdcf63862b3b3c94366f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"32\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866305eb4209fe134bd04f8b1f2faaa0c9ee313a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z:$\" width=\"18\" height=\"8\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd040522a33023aa00ae7335c2b54b22835af4c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (x+y+z)(x+y-z)(x-y+z)(-x+y+z) &amp;= \\cdots \\\\ &amp;= \\left(2xy\\right)^2 - \\left(x^2+y^2-z^2\\right)^2 \\\\ &amp;= 4x^2y^2 - x^4 - y^4 - z^4 - 2x^2y^2 + 2y^2z^2 + 2z^2x^2 \\\\ &amp;= 2x^2y^2 + 2y^2z^2 + 2z^2x^2 - x^4 - y^4 - z^4. \\end{align*}\" width=\"746\" height=\"103\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Algebra:_Specific.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Algebra:_Specific)\">Solution 2 (Algebra: Specific)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Algebra: Specific)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We group the first and last factors as well as the two middle factors, then apply the difference of squares repeatedly:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d77c6b8394787c15ca7c8616196eeb79bc509bb6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left(\\left(\\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{7}\\right)^2 - \\sqrt{5}^2\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{5}^2 - \\left(\\sqrt{6} - \\sqrt{7}\\right)^2\\right) &amp;= \\left(13 + 2\\sqrt{42} - 5\\right)\\left(5 - \\left(13 - 2\\sqrt{42}\\right)\\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\left(2\\sqrt{42} + 8\\right)\\left(2\\sqrt{42} - 8\\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\left(2\\sqrt{42}\\right)^2 - 8^2 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{104}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"674\" height=\"153\" />\n~Azjps (Solution)\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM (Revision)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Geometry.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Geometry)\">Solution 3 (Geometry)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Geometry)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that in a triangle with side-lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/1/001bae68f3dc240e8085e55759faffa91eb2e1f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt5,2\\sqrt6,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db6e9291fdd668a64ecb5657f7fba6381bb7197f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt7,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> by Heron's Formula, the area is the square root of the original expression.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the measure of the angle opposite the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/f/cbf76f1e122961538c9964afad6b8351500ddd89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> side. By the Law of Cosines,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76cdb3d9c1d29ec2bcf799fec4d69bb47812e2a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\left(2\\sqrt5\\right)^2+\\left(2\\sqrt{6}\\right)^2-\\left(2\\sqrt7\\right)^2}{2\\cdot 2\\sqrt5\\cdot2\\sqrt6}=\\frac{16}{8\\sqrt{30}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{15}},\\]\" width=\"433\" height=\"59\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa6c540e5d3d80b073324f779e241d01aa753b0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\theta=\\sqrt{1-\\cos^2\\theta}=\\sqrt{\\frac{13}{15}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"216\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>The area of the triangle is then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7bfd3372799ffd1f7fa72e771d358137164a014.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{2}\\cdot 2\\sqrt5\\cdot 2\\sqrt6=\\sqrt{\\frac{26}{30}}\\cdot 2\\sqrt{30}=\\sqrt{104},\\]\" width=\"320\" height=\"43\" />\nso our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/1/391198bd09bf058287c87dc9f4b3d9dc61af607d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\sqrt{104}\\right)^2=\\boxed{104}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"137\" height=\"35\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME\" title=\"1986 AIME\">1986 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\">AIME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">American Invitational Mathematics Examination</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017155543\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 169/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4663/50000